  "notes": "OsamaSon's early running mate — the joint tape *Ohsama* (2022) is the primary reference. Dark plugg archetype: sparse kicks, clap on 3, gliding restrained 808s, icy bells over short loops. ⚠ Confidence MEDIUM on thin press: this is the *Ohsama*-era sound rather than a career-spanning claim, and the entry says so rather than implying more coverage than the sources carry. ⚠ 333 distinct harmonies in 1000 seeds against a floor of 500, so the duration window widened and `1_per_bar` joined the harmonic rhythm — both true of the lane, and neither changes which chords are reachable.",
